   "k": "d8e3f33c2a",
   "src": "Here you will find articles on how we run marketplaces, news on platform changes and what they mean for brands, and press releases. Our monthly newsletter, the Kwontified Briefing, goes out by email. Search below, or filter by type, topic, channel, author or month.",
